- **优先级**: 自动检测并应用
- **更新日期**: 2025-10-06

---

## 🍎 核心原则

**基本真理**: Apple Silicon (ARM64) 架构与Intel x86架构不同,需要专项优化

**优化目标**:
- ✅ 充分利用ARM64原生性能
- ✅ 启用分层编译和AOT优化
- ✅ 并行编译最大化CPU利用率
- ✅ 减少Rosetta 2转译开销

---

## 📋 优化检查清单

### 检查1: 架构验证
```bash
# 验证系统架构
uname -m  # 应输出: arm64

# 验证.NET架构
dotnet --info | grep "Architecture"  # 应输出: arm64

# 验证Node.js架构
node -p "process.arch"  # 应输出: arm64
file $(which node)  # 应包含: arm64
```

### 检查2: .NET环境变量优化
```bash
# 在每次会话开始时设置以下环境变量:

# 启用ARM64原生编译优化
export DOTNET_TieredCompilation=1
export DOTNET_TieredPGO=1
export DOTNET_TC_QuickJitForLoops=1
export DOTNET_ReadyToRun=1

# 启用增量构建和并行编译
export DOTNET_CLI_TELEMETRY_OPTOUT=1
export DOTNET_SKIP_FIRST_TIME_EXPERIENCE=1
export DOTNET_NOLOGO=1

# npm ARM优化
export npm_config_arch=arm64
export npm_config_target_arch=arm64

# GC优化(适用于Apple Silicon高性能核心)
export DOTNET_GCHeapCount=8
export DOTNET_GCServer=1
```

### 检查3: MSBuild项目优化
```xml
<!-- Directory.Build.props.arm64 -->
<Project>
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(OS)' == 'Unix' AND '$([System.Runtime.InteropServices.RuntimeInformation]::ProcessArchitecture)' == 'Arm64'">
    <!-- ARM64原生优化 -->
    <RuntimeIdentifier>osx-arm64</RuntimeIdentifier>
    <PublishReadyToRun>true</PublishReadyToRun>
    <TieredCompilation>true</TieredCompilation>
    
    <!-- 并行构建 -->
    <BuildInParallel>true</BuildInParallel>
    <MaxCpuCount>0</MaxCpuCount>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>
```

